sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as 用户
  participant C as Web前端
  participant T as 埋点SDK
  participant S as API服务
  participant UP as UploadService
  participant OCR as OcrService
  participant LLM as LlmProvider
  participant AT as AttributionService
  participant FL as FollowupService
  participant TS as TrackingService

  Note over U,TS: ① R01 上传
  U->>C: 拍照/文本提交
  C->>S: POST /api/v1/upload (image/text, ctx)
  S->>UP: handleUpload()
  UP->>OCR: recognize(image/text)
  OCR->>LLM: chatWithImage(视觉模型)
  alt Ollama可用
    LLM-->>OCR: 标准化题干 + ocr_status
  else 不可达→Mock
    LLM-->>OCR: mock题干 + ocr_status=partial
  end
  OCR-->>UP: {ocr_status, question}
  UP->>UP: 生成 loop_id, 落 loop_sessions+mistakes
  UP-->>S: {loop_id, ocr_status, question}
  S-->>C: 200 {loop_id, ocr_status, question}
  C->>T: emit loop_upload (ctx+props)
  T->>S: POST /api/v1/track [loop_upload]

  alt ocr_status = fail
    C-->>U: 引导重拍 / 文本兜底（loop_upload 已含 fail 口径）
  else ocr_status = success/partial
    Note over U,TS: ② R02 归因
    C->>S: POST /api/v1/attribution {loop_id, question}
    S->>AT: generateAttribution()
    AT->>LLM: chat(归因 prompt)
    alt 超时(>25s)
      AT-->>S: {status:'analyzing'}
      S-->>C: 202 analyzing
      C-->>U: "正在分析" + 重试入口
    else 正常
      LLM-->>AT: {cause, knowledge_point, essence}
      alt 三项缺项
        AT-->>S: {status:'incomplete'}
        S-->>C: 200 incomplete → 前端标记待审，不展示
      else 三项齐全
        AT->>AT: 落 attributions(complete)
        AT-->>S: {status:'ok', cause, knowledge_point, essence, latency}
        S-->>C: 200 归因结果
        C->>T: emit loop_attr_show (attr_latency_ms, attr_has_three, knowledge_point, model_version)
        C-->>U: 三栏卡片展示
      end
    end

    Note over U,TS: ③ R03 认可/追问
    alt 认可
      U->>C: 点击"认可"
      C->>S: POST /api/v1/attribution/:loop_id/rate {approve}
      S->>AT: 更新 attributions.rate_action='approve'
      C->>T: emit attr_rate {rate_action:'approve'}
    else 不准确
      U->>C: 点击"不准确"
      C->>S: POST .../rate {inaccurate, reason}
      C->>T: emit attr_rate {rate_action:'inaccurate', inaccurate_reason}
    else 追问(限1次有效)
      U->>C: 点击"追问"
      C->>S: POST .../followup {message, round=1}
      S->>FL: generateFollowup()
      FL->>LLM: chat(苏格拉底补充归因)
      LLM-->>FL: 补充归因
      FL-->>S: {content, role:'ai_ask', has_next_action:true, remaining:0}
      S-->>C: 200 补充归因
      C->>T: emit followup {followup_round:1, role:'ai_ask', has_next_action:true}
      C-->>U: 展示补充归因 + 再次认可入口
      opt 达上限(remaining=0)
        FL-->>S: {has_next_action:false, msg:'已达当前追问深度'}
        C-->>U: 提示引导回练习(v0.2 接入)
      end
    end
  end
